# Allowlist for the simulator image (simulator.Dockerfile): everything is excluded, then only the
# files the build reads are let back in, so .env, .git, .venv, scratchpad/, caches, Terraform
# state and any file added later never reach the builder. The last matching rule wins.
*

# The uv workspace and its lock (both sync layers).
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!simulator/pyproject.toml
# The simulator package (second sync layer).
!simulator/src/
# The data files under SIM_HOME.
!simulator/catalogue.yaml
!simulator/config/
!simulator/schema/

# Host bytecode inside the exceptions above (another interpreter's, and stale): after them.
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
